955d","editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-011-luhuinan","book_id":"b-nanshi-011","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-011-luhuinan-ws2288359"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-luhuinan:p003","text":"孝建二年，追贈太后父興之散騎常侍，興之妻徐氏餘杭縣廣昌鄉君。大明四年，太后弟子撫軍參軍瓊之上表曰：「先臣故懷安令道慶賦命乖辰，自違明世。敢緣衞戍請名之典，特乞雲雨，微垂灑潤。」詔付門下。有司承旨奏贈給事中。瓊之及弟休之、茂之並超顯職。太后頗豫政事，賜與瓊之等財物，家累千金，居處服器，與帝子相侔。","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-041-luhuinan:p003:m0010","surface":"興之","start":10,"end":12,"person_id":"sde_n8n_9ko","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-luhuinan:p003:m0017","surface":"興之","start":17,"end":19,"person_id":"sde_n8n_9ko","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-luhuinan:p003:m0020","surface":"徐氏","start":20,"end":22,"person_id":"4p2_s17_v1v","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-luhuinan:p003:m0043","surface":"瓊之","start":43,"end":45,"person_id":"zwn_iir_orb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-luhuinan:p003:m0056","surface":"道慶","start":56,"end":58,"person_id":"0ej_lsn_fpk","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-luhuinan:p003:m0103","surface":"瓊之","start":103,"end":105,"person_id":"zwn_iir_orb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-luhuinan:p003:m0107","surface":"休之","start":107,"end":109,"person_id":"0ej_lsn_fpk_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-luhuinan:p003:m0110","surface":"茂之","start":110,"end":112,"person_id":"0ej_lsn_fpk_B","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-luhuinan:p003:m0126","surface":"瓊之","start":126,"end":128,"person_id":"zwn_iir_orb","kin